{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-panel-auth-data-b-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"gap-4","surface":"panel","area":"panel/auth-data","refs":["F-panel-1023","F-panel-1019","FN-B-run-panel-auth-data-a-01"],"severity":"S3","title":"A double payment from two desks is told only to the desk that sent it, and the note never clears when the owner sorts it","what":"When two desks took money for the same plan while offline, the desk that sends second gets a note: this member has now paid too much, please ask the owner to check. The same happens for a duplicate mobile number or a change another device overrode. The note is kept only in that one browser and goes away only when someone on that browser taps OK. The owner's own phone, Today and the bell never hear about the extra money, and if the owner fixes it from another device the note still sits on the desk.","expected":"An overpaid member or a duplicate found while sending shows up for the owner on every device (Today or the bell), and clears everywhere once it has been handled.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/data/outbox.ts:518-528","apps/dashboard/src/crm/data/outbox.ts:440-443","apps/dashboard/src/crm/data/cloud.ts:813-818","apps/dashboard/src/crm/data/cloud.ts:951-955","apps/dashboard/src/crm/data/outbox.ts:163-170"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"send-notes-kept-on-one-device","who":"owners with two or more desks that go offline","how_often":"each time two desks take money for the same plan offline","fix_line":"Save these notes with the gym on the server so the owner sees them on Today and they clear when the member is sorted","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
